# Build stamp. `public/version.txt` is regenerated on every build and never
# committed. `src/generated/version.json` IS committed, as a `dev` placeholder:
# the account menu is a client component, so it needs an import that always
# resolves. The build overwrites it, so a working copy can show as dirty after
# a local build — that is the cost of the import working everywhere.
/public/version.txt
